## Grid Geometry

- **Dimensions**: 128 × 128 × 128 cells (128³ = 2,097,152 cells per field)
- **Domain**: [-0.5, 0.5]³ (unit box, periodic on all faces)
- **Cell spacing**: dx = dy = dz = 1/128 ≈ 0.0078125
